Package: tsn
Title: Time-Series Network Construction
Version: 1.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Santtu", "Tikka",
           email = "santtuth@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")),
    person("Mohammed", "Saqr", role = c("aut", "cph")),
    person("Sonsoles", "L\u00f3pez-Pernas", role = c("aut", "cph"))
  )
Description: Constructs distance, visibility, and state-transition networks
    from univariate time series. The core constructor provides whole-series
    and sliding-window distance networks, natural and horizontal visibility
    graphs following Lacasa et al. (2008)
    <doi:10.1073/pnas.0709247105> and Luque et al. (2009)
    <doi:10.1103/PhysRevE.80.046103>, and optional state aggregation.
    Companion verbs expose discretization, trend classification, and an
    optional bridge to the 'Nestimate' transition-network models. Core network
    construction uses only packages distributed with R.
